## 5. Milestones

### M0 - Toolchain
- [x] Confirm `tree-sitter --version` (0.26.9), `node --version` (v26.8.2).
- [x] `git init` in ~/Projects/zed-raku; add .gitignore. (pre-existing)
- [~] rustup NOT installed; system Rust 1.98 already ships
      `wasm32-wasip1`/`wasm32-wasip2`, so cargo builds succeed. Zed may still
      want rustup at install time.

### M1 - Grammar
- [x] Decide grammar sourcing: (a) fork `acrion/tree-sitter-raku` ->
      `justaperlhacker/tree-sitter-raku`, commit generated `parser.c`, pin rev.
- [x] Clone grammar, run `tree-sitter generate`, verify `src/parser.c`.
- [x] Record upstream rev for reproducibility: upstream `5031abc8`.
- [x] Fork patches on top of upstream:
      - rev `5de6437d`: binary `~` string-concat operator; `multi`/`proto`/`only`
        declarators before `sub`/`method`.
      - rev `9a1a4aec`: typed signature params (`Int $n`, defaults, named
        `Int :$x`, slurpy `*@a`), return types (`--> T`, inside and outside the
        signature), and `given`/`when`/`default`. Subscript braces made
        `token.immediate` (Raku semantics) to disambiguate `given $x { ... }`
        from `$x{...}`.
      - rev `f905384e`: twigil variables (`$!x`, `$.x`, `@.list`, `%!map`,
        `$^x`, `$?x`, ...) and `has` attribute declarations (`has Int $.x is rw
        = 0;`).
      - rev `2414eb54`: POD scanner terminates at `=end` (nesting-aware), so
        `=begin pod ... =end pod` no longer swallows the rest of the file.
      - rev `070d051f`: `constant`/`subset` declarators, the Whatever star
        (`*`), pointy `for @a -> $x { ... }`, and angle subscripts
        (`%h<key>`).
      - rev `6b9a22ff`: Raku `.method(...)` / `.method: args` calls (`.` removed
        from the Perl concat operators; number literals now require digits
        after `.`, fixing `1..10` ranges) and paren-less `if`/`elsif`/`while`/
        `unless`/`until`/`for` conditions.
      - rev `b89f5957`: `is`/`does`/`handles` traits on class/role/package/sub/
        method/`has`; safe/meta method calls (`.?`, `.^`, `.&`, `.!`); named
        arguments (`:name`, `:name(...)`, `:name<...>`, `:$var`, `:!name`);
        sigilless variables (`my \x`).
      - rev `148563e0`: Raku `?? !!` ternary.
      - rev `bc95dafd`: all Raku phasers (`ENTER`, `LEAVE`, `KEEP`, `UNDO`,
        `FIRST`, `LAST`, `NEXT`, `PRE`, `POST`, `CATCH`, `CONTROL`, `COMPOSE`,
        `START` in addition to `BEGIN`/`CHECK`/`INIT`/`END`/`UNITCHECK`).
      All verified against the grammar's own test suite with no new failures.

